</header>

<!-- ================= HERO ================= -->
<section class="hero" id="home">
  <canvas id="netCanvas"></canvas>
  <div class="wrap hero-inner">
    <span class="hero-badge">● MikroTik · Cisco · Fiber · ISP-Grade Infrastructure</span>
    <h1>Your Network,<br>Our <em>Responsibility.</em></h1>
    <p>PM Solution designs, builds, secures and supports business networks across Dhaka — from office Wi-Fi and MikroTik/Cisco routing to fiber backbones. Certified engineers, transparent pricing, and support that actually answers.</p>
    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-p">Book a Free Site Survey</a>
      <a href="#services" class="btn btn-g">See Services & Pricing</a>
